  "content": "<p>增添可愛而深奧的大氣動物，強調美感。</p><p>是一個 <strong>NeoForge</strong> 的<strong>客戶端</strong>mod。原始 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cosy-critters\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fabric</a> 版本的移植版。</p><p>在我的<a href=\"https://discord.gg/m4EHeRjfZ9\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Discord</a>中找到支持！</p><p>( btw 有一個配置文件)</h3>鳥類<br>會飛下來停留在<strong>葉子</strong>、<strong>牆壁</strong>和<strong>柵欄</strong>上，受到騷擾時會四散飛走。<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1182393/description_d359fdf7-3715-4c33-8a1e-921720522159.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"800\" height=\"250\">小巧蜘蛛<br>從<strong>蛛網</strong>中出現，沿著牆壁、地板和天花板爬行。<code>#cosycritters:spider_spawnable</code>標記在蛛網上使用。<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1182393/description_84d680ca-1253-43d3-87ef-60dc51f51afc.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"800\" height=\"250\">飛蛾<br>被光吸引。將圍住任何<strong>火把</strong>或<strong>燈籠</strong>暴露於天空下。<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1182393/description_af4217f0-a748-4b05-a02f-b8b409af2f8b.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"800\" height=\"250\">帽人<br>???</p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1182393/description_74f67c1a-85b7-48e8-9197-84446d63a0d5.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"800\" height=\"250\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>如果您想支持我及其mod的開發，建議您嘗試 BisectHosting。使用代碼 \"project8gbderam\" 可享首月 25% 折扣。他們提供全天候支援和極速響應時間，確保您的需求得到妥善處理並提供卓越的遊戲輔助服務。</p><p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/linkout?remoteUrl=https://www.bisecthosting.com/project8gbderam\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.bisecthosting.com/project8gbderam</a></p><p><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/partners/custom-banners/54bb107c-f9fc-4f32-8515-fb4e3d56c124.png\" alt=\"\"></p>",
